# Requiem over Doom II MAP30 with monsters (P10): the Icon of Sin's brain killed by a
# route event on the first tic (the way to it is the set's: not walked); its death
# (A_BrainScream, A_BrainExplode) and A_BrainDie end the level, the last tic. Written by
# tools/RouteGen (requiem-map30-brain).
iwad doom2
pwad requiem
map MAP30
monsters
exit normal
# forwardmove sidemove turn buttons [xcount]; turn << 8 = angleturn
damage -64 -704 250
0 0 0 0 x117
